                                  History
                                  -------
1.o	- Initial version
1.1	- non-anonymous entries added (asks for optional handle-adding)
	- minor graphical changes & fixes
	- optimized
1.2	- added check for carrier loss (internal)
1.3	- added sort of "localized" output:
	  · language "0" is english (CNet default),
	  · language "1" is german.
1.4	- dropped localized output. Too much work.
	- cleaned up the code A LOT (jezuz... it woz my first arexx
	  program and everyone could see it... heheheh)
	- input length sensitives for writers handle
	- uses MCI for input, prints inputbox, chops leading spaces
	  (much more handy than using CNet-Rexx "prompt"!)
	- auto-checks height of ANSI.
	- renamed to 1oo% wall



